  "description": "WP1 adapted an existing knowledge graph explorer to consume the schema.org-compacted JSON-LD published by the csv-to-json-ld pipeline, bundling it into a browsable graph of entities and the properties that relate them. The tool supports filtering by work package, orphan detection for tasks and deliverables with no recorded output, and a coverage heatmap of entity kinds against work packages.",
